{"root":"selam","ipa":"/səlam/","core":"问候，致意，平安（源自阿拉伯语，常用于穆斯林群体或正式场合的问候）","pos":["名词"],"scenes":["高频","生活","教会"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/səlam/","zh":"问候，平安","phrases":[{"t":"memberi salam","zh":"致以问候"},{"t":"salam sejahtera","zh":"平安与祝福"},{"t":"salam tempel","zh":"（俚语）塞红包，私下给钱"}],"examples":[{"t":"Dia memberi salam kepada semua orang yang hadir.","zh":"他向所有在场的人致以问候。"},{"t":"Salam sejahtera bagi kita semua.","zh":"愿平安与祝福伴随我们所有人。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"selam","ipa":"/səlam/","zh":"问候","phrase":{"t":"salam hangat","zh":"热情的问候"},"example":{"t":"Terima kasih atas salam Anda.","zh":"感谢您的问候。"}},{"w":"bersalam","ipa":"/bərsalam/","zh":"互相问候，握手致意","phrase":{"t":"bersalam-salaman","zh":"互相握手问候"},"example":{"t":"Mereka bersalam sebelum memulai rapat.","zh":"他们在会议开始前互相握手致意。"}},{"w":"menyalami","ipa":"/məɲalami/","zh":"向某人致意，与某人握手","phrase":{"t":"menyalami tamu","zh":"向客人致意"},"example":{"t":"Presiden menyalami para atlet setelah pertandingan.","zh":"总统在比赛结束后与运动员们握手致意。"}},{"w":"penyalaman","ipa":"/pəɲalaman/","zh":"问候的行为或过程","phrase":{"t":"proses penyalaman","zh":"问候的过程"},"example":{"t":"Penyalaman itu dilakukan dengan sangat sopan.","zh":"那次问候进行得非常有礼貌。"}}],"derSlugs":["selam","bersalam","menyalami","penyalaman"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-27T16:42:44.559Z","src":"base"}